{"a":[6,11],"h":"<p>6.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"63\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 62.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 39.7 39.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 46.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> İşte bunlar - bu ıhtar olunan tekvînî âyetler ve onları anlatan bu tenzîlî âyetler, bu Sûre <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 106.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.6 53.3 53.3 69.7 76.6 83.3 83.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"76.6 90.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allahın âyetleridir. - Allahın kudret ve irâdesini, hikmet ve ahkâmını anlatmak için ikame ve tenzîl buyurduğu delillerdir. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"295\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 295.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 48.7 48.7 48.7 57.0 57.0 72.7 72.7 79.6 79.6 86.3 93.0 99.7 99.7 106.6 123.7 123.7 130.6 130.6 130.6 137.3 144.7 160.6 169.6 169.6 176.3 192.0 192.0 208.6 215.3 215.3 224.3 245.3 245.3 245.3 258.7 265.6 265.6 272.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 93.0 106.6 160.6 176.3 224.3 258.7 272.3 279.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah ve âyetlerinden sonra artık hangi söze inanacaklar - ya'ni Allaha ve âyetlerine inanmadıktan sonra o iymansızlar hangi söze inanırlar, hiç? 7. 8.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"369\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 368.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 28.4 36.0 60.7 60.7 67.4 67.4 67.4 74.3 81.7 97.4 97.4 114.0 120.7 127.4 127.4 143.3 143.3 152.3 16